[{"id":168971353,"discussion_id":"92750be58db48fa8b19565bdb657fa25a11ce459","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-transformer/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| moe | ✅ [*chen-linxin4*](https://gitcode.com/chen-linxin4), [*songkai111*](https://gitcode.com/songkai111) (2/2) | ✅ [*chen-linxin4*](https://gitcode.com/chen-linxin4), [*songkai111*](https://gitcode.com/songkai111) (2/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n\n------\n\n## CLA Signature Pass  \n guoqiuhao, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-04-21T15:19:24+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-22T15:21:16+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":168971516,"discussion_id":"b3982ce52017337f5733794a1db41de5c877c62d","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR旨在增强MoE（Mixture of Experts）路由梯度计算内核在开发和调试阶段的可观测性。通过在内核的关键执行路径中添加调试打印语句，便于开发人员观察和验证前几个批次（batch）的梯度缩放因子（gradScale）计算值、数据加载、索引映射以及核心计算逻辑的正确性，从而辅助定位和解决潜在问题。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n在MoE反向传播算子的多个内核实现中，策略性地插入了`PRINTF`调试打印语句。主要修改包括：在`MoeFinalizeRoutingV2GradRegbase`类的`CopyOutGradScales`函数中，为前3个批次打印梯度缩放因子；在`MoeFinalizeRoutingV2GradRegbaseNotCutH`类的构造函数、`Process`循环、`InitAllGlobalBuffer`及`CopyIn`等函数中，添加了内核启动标识、块处理范围、扩展行索引、特定行触发条件、关键缓冲区数据以及输入张量（如`expandedX`, `gradY`, `bias`）的前几个元素值等信息的输出。所有调试代码均通过条件判断（如`batchIdx < 3`）控制，以避免对生产环境性能造成影响。","created_at":"2026-04-21T15:20:28+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-21T15:20:28+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":168971881,"discussion_id":"60a4d6457019c2d8817db3817fbb5abe53eff4ab","body":"<div style='font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.2;'><div style='font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 4px;'>逻辑运算与副作用: 在CopyIn函数中，当batchIdx == 0时打印调试信息，但expertIdx变量只在IsBiasExist为true的代码块中定义。当IsBiasExist为false时，第238行的expertIdx变量未定义，可能导致编译错误或未定义行为。</div><div style='margin: 1px 0;'><strong>问题类型</strong>: 逻辑运算与副作用</div><div style='margin: 1px 0;'><strong>文件路径</strong>: <code style='font-size: 11px;'>moe/moe_finalize_routing_v2_grad/op_kernel/arch35/moe_finalize_routing_v2_grad_regbase_not_cut_h.h</code></div><div style='margin: 1px 0;'><strong>行号</strong>: 237</div><div style='margin: 3px 0 1px 0; font-size: 11px;'><strong>问题代码</strong>:</div><pre style='margin: 1px 0; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10px; background: #f5f5f5; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 2px; overflow-x: auto;'>if (batchIdx == 0) {\n    PRINTF(\"expertIdx[0] = %d\\n\", expertIdx);\n    PRINTF(\"bias[0][0] = %f\\n\", static_cast<T1>(biasUb.GetValue(0)));\n    PRINTF(\"bias[0][1] = %f\\n\", static_cast<T1>(biasUb.GetValue(1)));\n    PRINTF(\"bias[0][2] = %f\\n\", static_cast<T1>(biasUb.GetValue(2)));\n}</pre><div style='margin: 3px 0 1px 0; font-size: 11px;'><strong>修改建议</strong>:</div><pre style='margin: 1px 0; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10px; background: #f0f8ff; border: 1px solid #cce0ff; border-radius: 2px;'>将调试输出代码移到IsBiasExist条件编译块内部，或者使用条件编译确保只在IsBiasExist为true时执行相关调试输出。例如：\nif (batchIdx == 0 && IsBiasExist) {\n    PRINTF(\"expertIdx[0] = %d\\n\", expertIdx);\n    // ...\n}</pre><div style='margin-top: 4px; font-size: 9px; color: #999;'>---<br>此评论由代码审查工具自动生成</div></div>","created_at":"2026-04-21T15:22:06+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-22T10:03:34+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"68ca59ff08f52b2edaf33c5e","login":"guoqiuhao","object_id":"68ca59ff08f52b2edaf33c5e","name":"Guoqh","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/guoqiuhao"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":237,"end_new_line":237,"position_type":"text"}},{"id":168971883,"discussion_id":"2f4b3c51c14360fef320c7030e741bb1163857db","body":"<div style='font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.2;'><div style='font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 4px;'>变量初始化: 第238行引用的expertIdx变量在第232行定义，但该定义位于if constexpr (IsBiasExist)条件编译块内。当IsBiasExist为false时，expertIdx变量未定义，但第238行的PRINTF语句仍然尝试使用它，这会导致编译错误。</div><div style='margin: 1px 0;'><strong>问题类型</strong>: 变量初始化</div><div style='margin: 1px 0;'><strong>文件路径</strong>: <code style='font-size: 11px;'>moe/moe_finalize_routing_v2_grad/op_kernel/arch35/moe_finalize_routing_v2_grad_regbase_not_cut_h.h</code></div><div style='margin: 1px 0;'><strong>行号</strong>: 238</div><div style='margin: 3px 0 1px 0; font-size: 11px;'><strong>问题代码</strong>:</div><pre style='margin: 1px 0; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10px; background: #f5f5f5; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 2px; overflow-x: auto;'>PRINTF(\"expertIdx[0] = %d\\n\", expertIdx);</pre><div style='margin: 3px 0 1px 0; font-size: 11px;'><strong>修改建议</strong>:</div><pre style='margin: 1px 0; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10px; background: #f0f8ff; border: 1px solid #cce0ff; border-radius: 2px;'>将expertIdx变量的定义移到if constexpr块外部，或者将整个调试输出块也放入if constexpr条件中。更好的做法是重构代码，确保所有变量在使用前都已正确定义。</pre><div style='margin-top: 4px; font-size: 9px; color: #999;'>---<br>此评论由代码审查工具自动生成</div></div>","created_at":"2026-04-21T15:22:06+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-22T10:03:36+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"68ca59ff08f52b2edaf33c5e","login":"guoqiuhao","object_id":"68ca59ff08f52b2edaf33c5e","name":"Guoqh","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/guoqiuhao"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":238,"end_new_line":238,"position_type":"text"}},{"id":169068653,"discussion_id":"00df0eaa6c6de5e83d83a7ec17202c859fe7a040","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-04-22T10:03:46+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-22T10:03:46+08:00","user":{"id":"68ca59ff08f52b2edaf33c5e","login":"guoqiuhao","object_id":"68ca59ff08f52b2edaf33c5e","name":"Guoqh","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/guoqiuhao"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":169068874,"discussion_id":"1eec7381f00d3c3dae5c644c23d8d7c5e3bf8cc1","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=3537b826c3c54622a4fd365051123f9e&pipelineRunId=8bc48046238c4a82a1418f959b212e72&projectName=CANN'>8bc48046238c4a82a1418f959b212e72</a></b>][<b><a href='https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/ci/ci_guide.md'>流水线指导</a></b>]\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse\"><tr><th>任务名称</th><th>状态</th><th>日志</th><th>下载